px 0px;text-align:left;vertical-align:middle;word-wrap:break-word">
            If the passenger=E2=80=99s journey involves an ultimate destinat=
ion or stop in a country other than the country of departure, the Montreal C=
onvention or the Warsaw Convention may be applicable. These conventions gove=
rn and in most cases limit the liability of carriers for death or personal i=
njury and in respect of loss or damage to baggage. Please refer to the
            <a style=3D"color:#660f6e;font-weight:normal" href=3D"https://wi=
zzair.com/en-gb/legal/general-conditions-of-carriage-for-passengers-and-bagg=
age?utm_source=3Dwizz&amp;utm_medium=3Demail&amp;utm_campaign=3Dsystem_email=
_itinerary_confirmation&amp;utm_content=3Dclaims">general conditions of carr=
iage</a>
            and applicable national and international legislation for comple=
te information regarding air carriers=E2=80=99 liability limits and claims p=
rocedures.
